      "comment": "GRAVITY MONELLI (1) boasts a strong record this journey here with two wins and two minors from six tries. Scored by 9 lengths last time (37.35) in a Grade 5 over 652m at Mandurah. Looks the one to beat with even luck. TWIN FIN (6) skirted wide from an outside draw last start and found the front, leading throughout to win (29.58) at this track in a Grade 5 over 520m. Winner at her latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Deserves serious consideration again. EXILE DANCER (4) is a last start winner over 520m at this track when settled just off the lead but loomed up to claim a Novice race (29.99). Expected to enjoy the longer journey for the first time here. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. JUST A BINDI (8) has claims fresh from a recent placing.",
